<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>CISA KEV 数据分析报告</title>
  <style>{{ css }}</style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳至正文</a>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities</p>
      <h1>KEV 冻结快照分析报告</h1>
      <p class="lead">数据验证、目录加入时间、规定处置期限与勒索软件活动利用确认状态</p>
      <div class="meta-grid" aria-label="数据集摘要">
        <div><span>目录版本</span><strong>{{ metadata.catalogVersion }}</strong></div>
        <div><span>发布日期</span><strong>{{ metadata.dateReleased[:10] }}</strong></div>
        <div><span>记录数</span><strong>{{ metadata.count | integer }}</strong></div>
        <div><span>验证状态</span><strong>{{ "通过" if validation.passed else "未通过" }}</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <nav class="toc" aria-label="报告目录">
    <a href="#overview">概览</a><a href="#quality">数据质量</a><a href="#temporal">时间趋势</a>
    <a href="#deadline">处置期限</a><a href="#ransomware">勒索软件状态</a><a href="#limitations">解释边界</a>
  </nav>
  <main id="main">
    {% include "sections/01_overview.html.j2" %}
    {% include "sections/02_data_quality.html.j2" %}
    {% include "sections/03_temporal.html.j2" %}
    {% include "sections/07_limitations.html.j2" %}
  </main>
  <footer>由本地冻结快照生成 · 报告可离线打开 · 占比在数据文件中保存为 [0,1] 小数</footer>
</body>
</html>
